		'
			<p> Hello</p>
			<p> The source code for PWCT 2.0 was released on 2025.01.03 </p>
			<p> Running PWCT 2.0 from Source Code (Windows/Linux/macOS)</p>
			<p> 1. Install the <a href="https://ring-lang.github.io"> Ring programming language </a></p>
